 "answer": {
  "headline": "The 2011→2012 mammalia roadkill hindcast passed all declared checks; 6 road cells are selected for renewed monitoring.",
  "detail": "The highest-scoring 20% of surveyed road cells contained 55.0% of withheld 2012 roadkill individuals. This tests historical persistence across the source's monsoon-to-summer split and does not establish current risk.",
